  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of the Sustainable Cooling and Cold-Chain Progamme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the appraisal is to assess the quality and feasibility of the proposed programme&#x2019;s design and documentation, based on the Danida Aid Management Guidelines and against the strategic priorities in the Danish Strategy for Development Cooperation and the Africa Strategy. The appraisal will provide recommendations on the necessary adjustments for follow-ups to be taken prior to submission of the final programme for approval.</narrative>
